title: "Gemini Web2API — Unified AI Gateway"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A local protocol-translation gateway that unifies Gemini, Qwen and
  ChatGPT-compatible web backends behind OpenAI-style and Anthropic-compatible
  interfaces with streaming, model discovery and developer tooling.
